# WEBKIT_GST_TS_CC_FIX (default ON, =0 disables): keep MPEG-TS continuity
# counters continuous across HLS fragments in WebKitWebSrc.
#
# Pornhub (phncdn) ends every .ts fragment with zero-payload packets that walk
# each PID's continuity counter up to 15. GStreamer's tsdemux only counts
# packets with payload bytes, so it flags the next fragment's first packet as a
# continuity mismatch and, with a PES in progress, discards it and everything
# up to the next packet start: the IDR frame opening every fragment. Result:
# mosaic ~3 s into every video (first fragment is 3 s), with both the hardware
# and the software decoder, on the Xperia and the Jolla. The same segments
# played as one local file, or over HLS after the fix, play clean (tsdemux
# mismatches 4 -> 0 on a local HLS replay of three real fragments).
#
# The fix renumbers continuity counters per PID with a constant shift per
# response (no payload byte is changed), and never ends a buffer inside a TS
# packet header. Only responses that look like MPEG-TS are touched.
